  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có cơ số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên nghịch biến trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>log</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>π</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>16</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mroot><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mroot><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có cơ số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên đồng biến trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>16</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay \t\t\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mroot><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
